# oracle: fix sgcmc with window_size 0.6 (margin 0.4 L < 2 cutoffs: the oversized window, densities and types communicated after every trial), serial mode with the variance constraint (the species counts in the first acceptance test), group of the atoms with x below 16 A, pair eam/fs VFe_mm.eam.fs, 1024 bcc atoms, NVE, an MC event every 10 steps, 30 steps.
# oracle-potentials: VFe_mm.eam.fs
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
lattice bcc 2.855
region box block 0 8 0 8 0 8
create_box 2 box
create_atoms 1 box
set type 1 type/fraction 2 0.1 12345
pair_style eam/fs
pair_coeff * * VFe_mm.eam.fs Fe V
timestep 0.002
velocity all create 1200 4928459 dist gaussian
region left block INF 16 INF INF INF INF units box
group left region left
fix integrate all nve
fix mc left sgcmc 10 0.3 600 0.1 randseed 5555 window_size 0.6 serial variance 500 0.15
thermo_style custom step temp pe press f_mc[1] f_mc[2] f_mc[3] f_mc[4]
thermo_modify format float %.15g
thermo 10
run 30
